| `scripts/changed_cache.py` | Resolves the changed-tests cache path: check_H judges relative spelling and checkout confinement without git; the runner also refuses tracked and unignored paths. | imported; no CLI | [`tests.cache_dir`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Stdlib-only and 3.6-safe for the evidence writer. The runner requires git to prove the path is ignored before writing. Not for running pytest: `scripts/changed_tests.py` owns the loop. | [dev-loops.md](../guides/dev-loops.md) | always |
